{"facts":[
["gossip","658","text","Ah, well aren't you a sturdy-looking one? Perhaps you can assist me with a thing or two. Not much help around here except for green apprentices, and they've other things to worry about.",null,["efe3f5ff"]],
["gossip","1229","text","The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!",null,["ff78f410"]],
["gossip","1231","text","I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a warrior trainer.",null,["6a8845a8"]],
["gossip","1241","text","Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can.",null,["eb3dadd9"]],
["gossip","1243","text","Hegnar Rumbleshot, at your service!",null,["bd5da177"]],
["gossip","1247","text","Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty.",null,["a0a2b50d"]],
["gossip","1247","text","What can you do at an inn?\n\nWell when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.\n\nYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn.",null,["ba63a62d"]],
["gossip","1699","text","Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!",null,["591e6bc9"]],
["gossip","1699","text","I can teach you how to cook!",null,["78a53638"]],
["gossip","2326","text","I can train you in First Aid techniques.",null,["24ec24fe"]],
["gossip","6119","text","I wish the snow would just all melt away. It's always getting my robe wet and messing up everything!",null,["f2b8e32e"]],
["gossip","7954","text","You need to be exalted with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, warrior.",null,["cfc32ea7"]],
["gossip","11145","text","Greetings, $N. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge.",null,["d56fa4c7"]],
["gossip","271546","text","Lookin' fer the courier? Just flew off like a wee bird.\r\n\r\nCan't say I blame the poor sod. These wendigos are nasty business.",null,["e719e5c8"]],
