["quest","179","details","What do we have here? You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm?\n\nI'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves. And, being the kind soul that I am, I'd be more than happy to provide you with a suitable pair. I've one condition, however.\n\nI need you to go get me some wolf meat. Nice arrangement, hm? You bring me some wolf meat, and I'll make sure you don't lose any digits to frostbite. Well, what do you say?","70450",["eadd9cf3"]],
["quest","179","ender","npc:658","70450",["9de05506"]],
["quest","179","giver","npc:658","70450",["ecca565c"]],
["quest","179","objectives","Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat.","70450",["11d1ec8c"]],
["quest","179","request","Wolves giving you a bit of trouble? You'd do well to avoid the fangs and claws and other sharp bits, yes?","70450",["9314933a"]],
["quest","179","reward","Ah! Wonderful. The wolf meat should do nicely. Oh, don't worry, $N, I wouldn't forget my part of the bargain. Here, one of these should fit you.","70450",["b485dd88"]],
["quest","179","title","Dwarven Outfitters","70450",["96a72d68"]],
["quest","179","where","[1426,29.9,71.3]","70450",["35ff7441"]],
["quest","287","details","I'm behind on my report, and could use your help, $N. I just managed to find where the trolls are holed up, but I saw so many trolls, I was afraid to go in.\n\nHere's what I need... Go down to the cave, poke around inside, kill a few of the trolls, then come back here.\n\nTake the road north out of Kharanos, when you get to the bridge, follow the frozen river west until you reach Iceflow Lake. You'll find Brewnall Village on the west bank. The Hold is southwest of the village.","70450",["74f976fa"]],
["quest","287","giver","npc:1252","70450",["c5e715c4"]],
["quest","287","objectives","Explore Frostmane Hold, and kill 5 Frostmane Headhunters for Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos.","70450",["23bc4d94"]],
["quest","287","title","Frostmane Hold","70450",["c006193d"]],
["quest","287","where","[1426,46.7,53.7]","70450",["7249ae50"]],
["quest","313","ender","npc:1377","70450",["8178af81"]],
["quest","313","request","Hey, $N.  Been to the Grizzled Den yet?  Those Wendigos can be fierce.","70450",["df0a4577"]],
["quest","313","reward","Ah yes, these manes will work great!  You show a lot of grit, $C - I wager we'll see great things from you.","70450",["e01a232e"]],
["quest","317","ender","npc:1378","70450",["89eccd17"]],
["quest","317","request","Preparations are going well.  How goes your hunting?","70450",["a5e0314d"]],
["quest","317","reward","By Magni's beard, you sure did a lot of hunting!!  Thank you, $N.","70450",["4d6a0133"]],
["quest","318","details","Rejold Barleybrew experiments with his brews.  Some of them taste good, some bad, and some...well, some will lay all but the stoutest dwarf flat.\n\nHe lives at Brewnall Village, west of Kharanos, and one of his drinks, Evershine, is what I want.  It'll help keep me warm while I'm on the cold road.\n\nAnd...the blessed stuff burns so hot I can throw it in Jetsteam's furnace for a burst of power!  That little tactic has gotten me out of more than one tight spot.","70450",["2adfc325"]],
["quest","318","giver","npc:1378","70450",["0bb853c5"]],
["quest","318","objectives","Get a cask of Evershine from Rejold Barleybrew in Brewnall Village.","70450",["fb9b8a6a"]],
["quest","318","title","Evershine","70450",["9263b602"]],
["quest","318","where","[1426,49.4,48.4]","70450",["d2b700c1"]],
["quest","384","ender","npc:1267","70450",["ac3fd73f"]],
["quest","384","request","I'm going to need six crag boar ribs and a mug of Rhapsody Malt, $N.","70450",["a526d804"]],
["quest","384","reward","The Malt is brewed, the Boars are dead\nAnd before all is done and anything said\nWe will have to fight for first dibs\nOn these savory Beer Basted Boar Ribs!","70450",["f5811765"]],
["quest","5541","ender","npc:1243","70425",["3e9c36d4"]],
["quest","5541","request","I hope you're not here for ammo, because I'm almost out!","70425",["c7ba28d6"]],
["quest","5541","reward","Great, more ammo!  Old Loslor's shipment finally came through!  The ammo might be late, but just like my grand daddy used to tell me: late's better than never!\n\nThank you much, $N.  I already have buyers eager for this stuff!","70425",["1a327b7e"]],
["quest","96629","ender","npc:1699","70450",["a7fb7e01"]],
["quest","96629","reward","With this, you'll be able to set up a camp anywhere out in the wilderness. What you've learned is just the basics, so you won't be able to place too many furnishings around it.\r\n\r\nRaise your cooking skill and you might just be able to learn to make even bigger fires.\r\n\r\nYou can also learn the basics of furnishing your campsites from other tradeskill trainers if you're savvy in their skills.","70450",["5ca3f53c"]],
["quest","98319","details","It's bad enough havin' a troll problem, but the mountains are filled tae the brim with wendigos! They normally keep to their own caves, but they seem tae be spreadin' like bunnies. Now they've filled the Grizzled Den north of here.\r\n\r\nIf we want Whitebeard's report, we're gonna need to find my partner Cornelius. The blockhead got a little too excited and charged in head first. Brave, but stupid.\r\n\r\nHead into the cave and see where he is. And feel free to take out some of the beasts while yer at it.","70425",["09d2258c"]],
["quest","98319","ender","npc:271546","70425",["61edb52d"]],
["quest","98319","giver","npc:271546","70425",["f86fe4e4"]],
["quest","98319","objectives","Find Mountaineer Cornelius in the Grizzled Den for Mountaineer Gretchen.","70425",["5f89addc"]],
["quest","98319","reward","Ach, the fool...\r\n\r\nThank ye for the help, $N. Guess we have our report.","70425",["88dd4a8c"]],
["quest","98319","title","Secure the Mountain","70425",["2f5a97e4"]],
["quest","98319","where","[1426,44.1,57]","70425",["247ebf3e"]],
["quest","98321","ender","npc:1241","70450",["1ee4e374"]],
["quest","98321","request","Wendigos are nasty beasties. It's just good all the miners made it out of the Grizzled Den in one piece!","70450",["558eba8b"]],
["quest","98321","reward","Now that's more like it! With these shipments we'll get the forge back up and runnin' in no time!","70450",["001dd2bb"]],
["quest","98322","ender","npc:271546","70425",["c5b64bd1"]],
["quest","98322","reward","Ol' Whitebeard sent ya, aye?\r\n\r\nI got his report, alright. This whole situation's a mess!","70425",["489e2d9c"]],
["quest","98323","details","Hopefully ye put down a fair number of the mongrels while you were in there. Shame about Cornelius, though.\r\n\r\nFrom what you described, there's not much to report other than the cave is a lost cause. Whitebeard's not gonna like that answer, but I'm not darin' sendin' anybody else into that death trap.\r\n\r\nFeel free tae pass along the message, $N. I'm not leavin' this spot till the mountain's secure.","70450",["be8e2810"]],
["quest","98323","ender","npc:1252","70450",["e2163de4"]],
["quest","98323","giver","npc:271546","70450",["c1c6fafe"]],
["quest","98323","objectives","Deliver Mountaineer Gretchen's Report back to Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos.","70450",["7ff416dc"]],
["quest","98323","request","Ah, you're back just in time.\r\n\r\nWhat's the matter, lad? You look like you've seen a ghost.","70450",["b2dd52c5"]],
["quest","98323","reward","Completely overrun? Why am I not surprised.\r\n\r\nWell, that's going in the report too.\r\n\r\n<Senir folds Gretchen's letter into his pile of notes>","70450",["45ac813b"]],
["quest","98323","title","Secure the Mountain","70450",["7a10bbf6"]],
["quest","98323","where","[1426,44,57]","70450",["d3f8ecd5"]]
]}
